# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Summary statistics ARE distributed, as compressed archives (data/*.zip), and are
# extracted into data/gwas/ and data/eqtl/ on first run -- so ignore the extracted copies.
# The genotype LD panels are NOT distributed (data/ld_panels/): the GWAS-side panels are
# UK Biobank individual-level data (access-only) and the 1000G EUR panel is large.
# Provide your own LD panels under data/ld_panels/ (see the notebook overview).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/gwas/
data/eqtl/
data/ld_panels/

# Analysis outputs (regenerate by running the notebook)
results/

